[[Lok Lambert]] used the spell in Brittany, France to stun [[Celina]] on a rooftop. {{Source|The Seekers of Ys}}

A green version of Clatterbang was used by [[Diaz]] and his [[Suits]] to attack a house. This form of Clatterbang was fired like a projectile {{source|The Bulls of Pamplona}}

Clatterbang was used by [[Lok Lambert]] in [[Organization Central]] to render the [[Suit]] "[[Beta]]" unconscious. {{Source|Doorway to Huntik}}

This spell was later used by [[Dante Vale]] to disorientate [[Wilder]] whilst fighting in [[Hernán Cortés' vault]]. {{source|The Power of Umbra}}

*Clatterbang is the first spell to appear in the ''[[Huntik Magazine]]'' comics prior to appearing in the TV series with an altered design.
*In the comics, Clatterbang is depicted as a long-range blast as opposed to a series of circular sound waves seen in the TV show. 

